@startuml
title D-04 Connector Health and Projection Freshness Dashboard Flow

actor "Technical Operations /\nSupport User" as Support
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
participant "Connector Instance" as Connector
participant "Central PMS /\nIntegration Health" as Health
participant "Management Dashboard" as Dash

Connector -> Vendor : Poll passageway/session data
Vendor --> Connector : Session/projection input or error
Connector -> Health : Publish status, last poll,\nlatency, failures, projection freshness
Health -> Dash : Authorized operational health view
Support -> Dash : Review connector status,\nfreshness, stale warnings

alt Projection fresh
  Dash --> Support : Show current operational visibility
else Projection stale or ambiguous
  Dash --> Support : Show stale warning and affected Site/Site Group
end

note over Dash
Freshness display is operational awareness.
It does not approve payment, tariff, fiscal,
discount, or exit decisions.
end note
@enduml
